1 CONC Erika, with about 500 Slovakian and Austrian Jewish refugees fleeing N
2 CONC azi persecution boarded the Pentcho, an old, slow, decrepit, paddlewhe
2 CONC el steamer. It was hired by the Revisionist Zionist organization Beta
2 CONC r as part of the Aliyah Bet immigration effort to get to British Manda
2 CONC te Palestine. After chugging down the Danube, crossing a stormy Blac
2 CONC k Sea, the ship had severe mechanical breakdowns. On 9 Oct 1940, in It
2 CONC alian territory, its boiler exploded into the Aegean Sea. It ran agrou
2 CONC nd on deserted island Kamilonissi. All passengers and crew got ashore
2 CONC ; 5 men took the sole lifeboat to seek help, got caught in a storm, bu
2 CONC t were rescued by a British destroyer.
